       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANG-DIFF.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ANG-DIFF-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ENERGY-DIFFUSION-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHASE-TRANSFER-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SLM-DIFFRACTION-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GS-DIFF-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GS-DIFF-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ANG-DIFF-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PAX-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PAX-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DIFF-AND-TRANS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SLM-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAX-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DIFF-AND-TRANS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENERGY-DIFFUSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE-TRANSFER-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SLM-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SLM-DIFFRACTION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GS-DIFF-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PAX-PROOFS.
           IF WS-ENERGY-DIFFUSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHASE-TRANSFER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SLM-DIFFRACTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GS-DIFF-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-GS-DIFF-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PAX-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PAX-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PAX-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PAX-CODE.
